## 追加すべきツールの設計

### 🛠️ **[Tool] retrieve_memory - 知識ベース検索ツール**

#### 概要
過去の成功パターン、ユーザー設定、ドメイン知識を効率的に検索・活用するツール

#### 入力
```javascript
{
  query: string,              // 検索クエリ
  search_type: "pattern" | "user_prefs" | "domain" | "all",
  filters: {
    user_id?: string,
    workspace_id?: string,
    complexity?: "simple" | "medium" | "complex",
    node_types?: string[],    // 含まれるノードタイプでフィルタ
    success_rate?: number,    // 成功率の閾値
  },
  limit: number              // 結果数上限
}
```

#### 出力
```javascript
{
  results: [
    {
      id: string,
      type: "pattern" | "preference" | "knowledge",
      content: {
        dsl_snippet?: string,
        metadata?: object,
        description: string,
      },
      relevance_score: number,
      usage_stats: {
        times_used: number,
        success_rate: number,
        last_used: date
      }
    }
  ],
  suggested_patterns: string[]  // 関連パターンの推奨
}
```

---

### 💰 **[Tool] cost_estimator - コスト・パフォーマンス推定ツール**

#### 概要
生成されたワークフローの実行コスト、処理時間、リソース使用量を事前に推定

#### 入力
```javascript
{
  workflow_structure: object,    // generate_workflow_structureの出力
  execution_params: {
    expected_requests_per_day: number,
    average_input_tokens: number,
    peak_concurrent_users?: number
  }
}
```

#### 出力
```javascript
{
  cost_breakdown: {
    llm_costs: {
      provider: string,
      model: string,
      input_tokens: number,
      output_tokens: number,
      cost_per_execution: number,
      monthly_estimate: number
    },
    api_costs: [{
      service: string,
      requests: number,
      cost_per_request: number,
      total: number
    }],
    total_monthly_cost: number
  },
  performance_metrics: {
    estimated_latency_ms: number,
    throughput_requests_per_second: number,
    bottlenecks: string[]
  },
  optimization_suggestions: [
    {
      type: "model_downgrade" | "caching" | "batching",
      potential_savings: number,
      implementation_effort: "low" | "medium" | "high"
    }
  ]
}
```

---

### 🔒 **[Tool] security_scan - セキュリティ・コンプライアンススキャナー**

#### 概要
生成されたDSLの潜在的なセキュリティリスクとコンプライアンス違反を検出

#### 入力
```javascript
{
  dsl_yaml: string,
  compliance_standards: string[],  // ["GDPR", "HIPAA", "SOC2"]
  organization_policies?: object
}
```

#### 出力
```javascript
{
  vulnerabilities: [
    {
      severity: "critical" | "high" | "medium" | "low",
      type: string,  // "hardcoded_secret", "unencrypted_pii", "excessive_permissions"
      location: string,  // YAMLパス
      description: string,
      remediation: string
    }
  ],
  compliance_issues: [
    {
      standard: string,
      requirement: string,
      violation: string,
      fix_required: boolean
    }
  ],
  risk_score: number,  // 0-100
  auto_fixable: string[],  // 自動修正可能な問題のID
  recommendations: string[]
}
```

---

### 📊 **[Tool] telemetry_logger - 実行メトリクス記録ツール**

#### 概要
生成されたワークフローの実行結果を記録し、将来の最適化に活用

#### 入力
```javascript
{
  workflow_id: string,
  execution_result: {
    success: boolean,
    duration_ms: number,
    tokens_used: number,
    error?: string
  },
  user_feedback?: {
    satisfaction: 1-5,
    modifications_made: string[],
    comments: string
  }
}
```

#### 出力
```javascript
{
  logged: boolean,
  insights: {
    pattern_performance: {
      success_rate_change: number,
      common_failure_reasons: string[]
    },
    optimization_opportunities: string[]
  }
}
```

---

### 📄 **[Tool] parse_external_schema - 外部スキーマ解析ツール**

#### 概要
OpenAPI、GraphQL、SQLスキーマなどを解析し、ワークフロー生成に活用

#### 入力
```javascript
{
  schema_type: "openapi" | "graphql" | "sql" | "json_schema",
  schema_content: string,
  extract_operations?: string[]  // 特定の操作のみ抽出
}
```

#### 出力
```javascript
{
  parsed_schema: {
    endpoints?: [{
      method: string,
      path: string,
      parameters: object[],
      response_schema: object
    }],
    data_models?: object,
    relationships?: object[]
  },
  suggested_nodes: [
    {
      type: "http-request" | "code",
      configuration: object,
      description: string
    }
  ],
  integration_notes: string[]
}
```

